## web — high-level web framework for Alya.
##
## Part of the Alya Language package ecosystem (https://github.com/alya-lang).
## Routing, middleware, JSON APIs, and views over `alya-lang/http`.
##
## ```alya
## import "web" as web
##
## function hello(ctx)
##     return web::ctx_json_map(ctx, {"message": "Hello"})
## end
##
## function main()
##     let app = web::app()
##     app.get("/hello", hello)
##     app.listen(8080)
## end
##
## main()
## ```

import "./types.alya"
import "./app.alya"
import "./middleware.alya"
import "./context.alya"
import "./views.alya"

## Creates a new App with default settings.
##
## ### Returns
## A new `App` ready for route registration.
##
## ### Examples
## ```alya
## let app = web::app()
## ```
pub function app() -> App
    return app_new()
end
